            "anchor_id": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong><br/>DOMESTIC (AUSTRALIA)<br/></strong>- Carrier: Australia Post Express with insurance.<br/>- Expected arrival date for orders is approximately 2-3 days from the shipment date.</p><p><strong><br/>INTERNATIONAL SHIPMENTS<br/></strong>- Carrier: Australia Post Express with insurance.<br/>- All duties, tariffs and import taxes are included at checkout.<br/>- Expected arrival date for international orders is approximately 7-10 days from the shipment date.</p><p><strong><br/>REFUSED SHIPMENTS<br/></strong>- If an order is refused, and automatically returned, the buyer is responsible for the original shipping charges <em>and</em> return shipping charges.</p>",
