        "collapsible_row_tDA8je": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WARRANTY",
            "anchor_id": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><br/>Lloyd Steven pieces are covered by a one-year warranty against craftsmanship faults.</p><p>This warranty does not apply to general wear, surface changes resulting from regular use, loss, or damage caused by improper handling. All warranty claims require inspection of the piece and proof of purchase prior to assessment.<br/><br/><br/><strong>SIZING + ADJUSTMENTS<br/></strong>Accurate ring sizing is the responsibility of the client at the time of order.</p><p>If a piece requires resizing or remaking due to an incorrect size being confirmed, a resizing fee will apply. The piece must be unworn and returned in original condition. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>WEAR<br/></strong>Depending on your finishings and plating appearance will show wear over time, particularly on rings and pieces worn frequently. This is considered normal and is not covered under warranty.</p><p>For plated finishes, occasional wear is recommended to preserve surface integrity.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>ASSISTANCE<br/></strong>For questions regarding warranty, sizing, or care, please contact the studio.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_BkJk8h": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DELIVERY AND LEAD TIMES",
            "anchor_id": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><br/>Please allow 5 business days for in stock items to ship. Custom orders are sent as soon as the pieces are finished, and the delivery window will be confirmed with you prior to manufacturing. </p><p>Once shipped, you will receive a shipment confirmation email with the tracking information for the parcel. <br/></p><p>Once shipped item is marked “delivered” by the carrier, Lloyd Steven is not responsible for lost or stolen parcels. Please opt for 'Signature-on-delivery' which is available at checkout. </p><p>Lost/stolen package claims must be made with the carrier.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zgLwrm": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "TERMS OF SERVICE",
            "anchor_id": "terms",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong><br/><br/>OVERVIEW</strong><br/>This website is operated by Lloyd Steven PTY LTD. Throughout the site, the terms “we”, “us”, and “our” refer to Lloyd Steven.</p><p>By accessing this website or purchasing from us, you agree to be bound by the following terms and conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our website or services.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>PRODUCTS + SERVICES</strong><br/>Lloyd Steven offers fine jewellery, including made-to-order and custom pieces.</p><p>Descriptions, imagery, and specifications are provided for general reference. Due to the nature of handcrafted work, slight variations may occur and are considered part of the character of each piece.</p><p>Custom commissions are subject to design approval prior to production. Once approved, orders cannot be cancelled or materially altered.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>PRICING + PAYMENT</strong><br/>All prices are listed in the currency displayed at checkout and are subject to change without notice.</p><p>Payment is required in full, or as otherwise agreed in writing, prior to production or shipment. Deposits for custom work are non-refundable once design approval has been confirmed.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>PRODUCTION + DELIVERY</strong><br/>Most pieces are made to order. Production timelines are estimates and may vary depending on complexity, materials, and availability.</p><p>Shipping timelines are provided as guidance only. Lloyd Steven is not responsible for delays caused by third-party carriers or customs processes.</p><p>Risk of loss passes to the customer upon delivery.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>RETURNS + EXCHANGES</strong><br/>Due to the made-to-order nature of our work, returns and exchanges are limited.</p><p>Eligibility for return, exchange, or repair is assessed on a case-by-case basis in accordance with our Returns & Refunds / Warranty / Care policies.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>CARE + WEAR</strong><br/>Fine jewellery is durable but will change with wear. Surface marks, patina, and material changes resulting from regular use are expected and are not considered defects.</p><p>Improper handling, alteration, or wear beyond intended use may void eligibility for repair or warranty consideration.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY</strong><br/>All content on this site, including imagery, text, and design elements, is the property of Lloyd Steven and may not be reproduced, distributed, or used without prior written consent.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>LIMITATION OF LIABILITY</strong><br/>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Lloyd Steven shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of this website or the purchase of our products.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>GOVERNING LAW</strong><br/>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>CONTACT</strong><br/>For questions regarding these terms or our services, please contact the studio.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
