            "heading": "POLICIES",
            "anchor_id": "",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><br/>These policies govern all purchases from <strong>lloydsteven.com</strong>, including domestic and international orders, shipping, returns, warranties, and privacy.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>DOMESTIC (AUSTRALIA)</strong><br/>- Carrier: Australia Post Express with insurance.<br/>- Expected arrival date for orders is approximately 2-3 days from the shipment date. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING</strong><br/>- Carrier: Australia Post Express with insurance.<br/>- All duties, tariffs and import taxes are included at checkout.<br/>- Expected arrival date for international orders is approximately 7-10 days from the shipment date. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>REFUSED SHIPMENTS</strong><br/>- If an order is refused, and automatically returned, the buyer is responsible for the original shipping charges <em>and</em> return shipping charges.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>REFUNDS + RETURNS</strong><em><br/>CHANGE OF MIND<br/></em>- Returns are accepted within 14 days of delivery for a full refund. <br/>- Items must be unworn, in original packaging, and accompanied by proof of purchase.<br/>- Returns can be shipped to our USA or Australian return address at the buyer's expense. <br/>- We do not offer returns on custom orders unless faulty. <br/>- Please email us prior to making a purchase if you have any questions about the eligibility of a return.<br/><br/><em>FAULTY ITEMS UPON DELIVERY<br/>- </em>Covered under <strong>Australian Consumer Law</strong> (ACL): entitled to repair, replacement, or refund if faulty, damaged, or not as described.<br/>- If your item is faulty, contact support with your order number and photos. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>WARRANTY AND REPAIR<br/></strong>- <strong>3-month warranty</strong> for manufacturing faults from delivery date.<br/>- Excludes wear, misuse, resizing, or accidental damage.<br/>- Out-of-warranty repairs available at customer expense (materials + shipping).</p><p><strong><br/><br/>SHIPPING POLICIES</strong><br/>- Orders are sent as soon as the pieces are finished. <br/>- Buyer receives a shipment confirmation email with the tracking information for the parcel. <br/>- Once marked “delivered” by the carrier, Lloyd Steven is not responsible for lost or stolen parcels.<br/>- Please opt for 'Signature-on-delivery' which is available at checkout.<br/>- Lost/stolen package claims must be made with the carrier. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>PRIVACY + DATA</strong><br/>- Data collected only for order fulfilment and communication.<br/>- Technical data (IP, browser) used for troubleshooting and analytics.<br/>- No unnecessary consent required.<br/>- Data stored securely and retained only as required by law.<br/>- <strong>GDPR Rights (EU Customers):</strong> access, correction, deletion, portability, restriction, objection. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>COMUNICATIONS</strong><br/>- Occasional emails and updates may be sent.<br/>- You can unsubscribe anytime.<br/>- We will not sell your personal data.</p><p><strong><br/><br/>POLICY CHANGE</strong><br/>We may update these policies from time to time. The “Last Updated” date reflects the most current version. Customers will be notified of major changes. </p><p><strong><br/><br/>FEEDBACK</strong><br/>All other feedback, comments, requests for technical support and other communications should be directed to: info@lloydsteven.com</p>",
